**std_include.cpp configures MSVC linker metadata, telemetry stubs, graphics preference, and Tommath RNG fallbacks.**

## Symbols

`__vcrt_initialize_telemetry_provider()`, `__telemetry_main_invoke_trigger()`, `__telemetry_main_return_trigger()`, `__vcrt_uninitialize_telemetry_provider()` are `extern "C"` no-op telemetry hooks.

`NvOptimusEnablement` exports `DWORD = 0x00000001`, enabling high-performance NVIDIA graphics.

`s_read_arc4random`, `s_read_getrandom`, `s_read_urandom`, `s_read_ltm_rng` accept `(void*, size_t)`, return `int -1`, disabling unavailable RNG sources.

## Linker contracts

Non-`DEBUG` builds merge sections into `.UPX0`–`.UPX4`; all builds embed Common Controls v6 manifest dependency.